- op: discuss  # 3b93
  at: '2026-05-09T02:30:36Z'  # 3b93
  by: agent  # 3b93
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 3b93
  clock: 3  # 3b93
  nonce: 3b93  # 3b93
  message: "Fixed in PR #3584 (commit ac21209c66). Added per-warning activation gate in check_partial_linker_requirements: looks up the linker spec by name and skips diagnostics whose linker.activation.should_run(detected_frameworks, detected_languages) returns False. Bypassed when both detection sets are empty so crafted-diagnostic test fixtures keep working unchanged. Three new tests cover suppress / regression-guard / no-op-on-empty paths.\n\nCoverage: addresses CGO, LUA_FFI, RUBY_FFI, and any other linker with framework or language_pairs activation. Does NOT address DEPENDENCY linker (always-on activation, no calling-language signal) — that's a separate issue (TOML-only manifest gap on Gradle/Bundler/go.mod targets) and continues to fire."  # 3b93
